WEBVTT

00:03:07.188 --> 00:03:09.668
(Juliet Blake) And now,
let's give a warm welcome

00:03:09.692 --> 00:03:15.568
to the artistic director emerita
of the Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater,

00:03:15.592 --> 00:03:17.028
Judith Jamison.

00:03:17.362 --> 00:03:24.084
(Applause)

00:03:24.108 --> 00:03:25.441
Judith Jamison: Thanks.

00:03:26.225 --> 00:03:27.375
How are y'all?

00:03:27.757 --> 00:03:28.963
(Audience cheers)

00:03:28.987 --> 00:03:31.146
JJ: Yeah, you know
you've just been to church?